    "interpretation": "Historical CI timings are diagnostic observations, not paired candidate/baseline measurements. Baseline main Go runtime install took313s while other Linux runtime hits took0-2s; earlier PR macOS runtime install took369s. This motivates separating producer runtime cache validity from consumer edits; no future elapsed-time or invoice saving is claimed.",
